			},
			"date": "2026-10-17T19:50:05.727Z",
			"content": "<p>What's the use case for using DSD in a Nuxtjs app?</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:z5uakvhfrevmlxmxlyiap6u5/app.bsky.feed.post/3my4znlhmhc2l",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:pefubtxqc5svtvsds725qgx3/app.bsky.feed.post/3my3ufa36c22j",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/iamallyniam.bsky.social/post/3my4znlhmhc2l",
			"private": true,
			"date": "2026-10-18T06:56:54.553Z",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:pefubtxqc5svtvsds725qgx3/app.bsky.feed.post/3my5in6mwis2j",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:z5uakvhfrevmlxmxlyiap6u5/app.bsky.feed.post/3my4znlhmhc2l",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/stuffbreaker.bsky.social/post/3my5in6mwis2j",
			"author": {
				"name": "Burton Smith",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/stuffbreaker.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:pefubtxqc5svtvsds725qgx3/bafkreiflfqfme6bk7akho6uhsi3bnjxrwgoh3gkb6lisi7lg4vhxjqaxzy"
			},
			"date": "2026-10-18T11:25:07.219Z",
			"content": "<p>Why do you need a shadow DOM in a Vuejs template? Nuxt has SSR and Vuejs already has slots and style encapsulation (although not as strict as a shadow DOM).</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:wlv2lek2tmwsfpob3r4mix7y/app.bsky.feed.post/3my5j74i7is2e",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:pefubtxqc5svtvsds725qgx3/app.bsky.feed.post/3my5in6mwis2j",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/konnorrogers.com/post/3my5j74i7is2e",
			"author": {
				"name": "Konnor Rogers",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/konnorrogers.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wlv2lek2tmwsfpob3r4mix7y/bafkreihcn5u3o5m6hmxjcmhzv2v3s6rltvslkcmxs2zlxi4rp6s77kybtm"
			},
			"date": "2026-10-18T11:35:08.951Z",
			"content": "<p>They said NextJS not Nuxt 😅</p>\n<p>And I dont think they implied writing the shadom dom directly. They're saying if they use a library of web components that can be SSR'ed (like Web Awesome) NextJS' Lit adapter only renders \"Shallowly\" without the shadow dom, and produces hydration errors in some cases.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:z5uakvhfrevmlxmxlyiap6u5/app.bsky.feed.post/3my5pnyd3d223",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:pefubtxqc5svtvsds725qgx3/app.bsky.feed.post/3my5in6mwis2j",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/iamallyniam.bsky.social/post/3my5pnyd3d223",
			"private": true,
			"date": "2026-10-18T13:30:50.356Z",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:wlv2lek2tmwsfpob3r4mix7y/app.bsky.feed.post/3my5pxs4v7k27",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:z5uakvhfrevmlxmxlyiap6u5/app.bsky.feed.post/3my5pnyd3d223",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/konnorrogers.com/post/3my5pxs4v7k27",
			"author": {
				"name": "Konnor Rogers",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/konnorrogers.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wlv2lek2tmwsfpob3r4mix7y/bafkreihcn5u3o5m6hmxjcmhzv2v3s6rltvslkcmxs2zlxi4rp6s77kybtm"
			},
			"date": "2026-10-18T13:36:19.406Z",
			"content": "<p>I modified the Astro SSR + DSD adapter one and fixed some bugs and it works with the latest version of Astro:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/shoelace-style/astro-lit\">github.com/shoelace-sty...</a></p>\n<p>I have a PR to Nuxt to upgrade to latest version of Lit that has languished:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/prashantpalikhe/nuxt-ssr-lit/pull/187\">github.com/prashantpali...</a></p>\n<p>(and looks like other PRs have improved on my PR)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:wlv2lek2tmwsfpob3r4mix7y/app.bsky.feed.post/3my5q32xxjc27",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:wlv2lek2tmwsfpob3r4mix7y/app.bsky.feed.post/3my5pxs4v7k27",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/konnorrogers.com/post/3my5q32xxjc27",
			"author": {
				"name": "Konnor Rogers",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/konnorrogers.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wlv2lek2tmwsfpob3r4mix7y/bafkreihcn5u3o5m6hmxjcmhzv2v3s6rltvslkcmxs2zlxi4rp6s77kybtm"
			},
			"date": "2026-10-18T13:38:09.345Z",
			"content": "<p>I have a small example using Vue + Vite:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/KonnorRogers/webawesome-vite-vue-ssr\">github.com/KonnorRogers...</a></p>\n<p>Svelte is probably next on my list to look at.</p>\n<p>NextJS seems like the odd one out for SSR, mostly because theres no real hooks into it, and last I heard talks stalled with the Next team and the Lit team.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:pefubtxqc5svtvsds725qgx3/app.bsky.feed.post/3my5vvvoius2j",
