			"date": "2026-10-18T16:05:15.978Z",
			"content": "<p>Sorry, I misread that.</p>\n<p>I agree. I'm not a big fan of the framework-specific solutions and would prefer a standards-based solution.</p>\n<p>I was hoping Declarative Custom Elements could help in this area.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://dev.to/stuffbreaker/how-declarative-custom-elements-dce-could-improve-web-components-53eg\">dev.to/stuffbreaker...</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
